sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Agent
    participant Tools as Tool runtime
    participant Search as Search API

    User->>Agent: Which release broke the p95?
    Agent->>Tools: tool_use(search, {"q": "p95 regression"})
    Tools->>Search GET /search?q=p95+regression
    Search-->>Tools: 3 hits
    Tools-->>Agent: tool_result(3 hits)
    alt enough evidence
        Agent->>User: Release 4.2 doubled the p95
    else needs another call
        Agent->>Tools: tool_use(fetch, {"url": "..."})
        Tools-->>Agent: tool_result(body)
        Agent->>User: Release 4.2 doubled the p95
